---
description: Convert exact native preview evidence into a precise recommendation.
args:
  preview: SystemCandidatePreview
returns: SystemCandidateDecision
---
Use hold-preview on limited; no real file text is available on at least one side. For absence use hold-absence when both sides oppose each other with edit versus removal, and review-incoming when native status is adopt and no local edit competes. Use hold-collision on collision, carry-both on compose, keep-converged on same-change, and review-incoming on incoming-only. Hold rather than making a destructive choice for the user.
